  "how": "PSI public API: GET https://psi.nasa.gov/geode-py/ws/repo/investigations/<PSI-ID> lists experimentalTable files; GET /geode-py/ws/studies/<PSI-ID>/download?file=<name>&version=<v>&redirect=false returns a signed S3 URL. Script: psi_combustion_download.py (team NASA folder).",
  "license": "NASA PSI data: public, no use restrictions; cite each investigation's dataset DOI (see flame/data/investigations.json).",
  "not_included": "PSI-60, PSI-62, PSI-115, PSI-117 have no experiment table (ground studies). Raw video/images (hundreds of GB) were not downloaded.",
  "companion_files": {
    "psi_combustion_index.csv": "one row per investigation: title, objectives, keywords, data volume, table names",
    "psi_tables_overview.csv": "what one row of each table is and whether it holds results",
    "psi_publications.csv": "publications listed in PSI for the solid-fuel/smoke investigations, with NTRS open-PDF links where found"
